{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分屏幕的感受词较密集，纵向交替阅读不如Y左右分栏直观，扫屏时容易被细节分散注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏更容易快速区分叙事和感受，阅读负担也比较均匀，但部分关键心理动机被压缩了，尤其S09把害怕孤单与愿意重新忍受旧日委屈之间的矛盾弱化了。X用重点放大建立了清晰的故事骨架，又通过随音乐出现的感受词呈现情绪和音乐变化的具体过程，前后从逃离、怀念、动摇到接受现实并继续生活，因果和情感转变都更完整。虽然X有些屏幕信息偏密，但作为整体，它让观众得到的心理细节和音乐体验更多，也更细腻。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d902fccd-ae0e-44cd-81dd-59c161175963", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T022436978796Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:25:54.999793+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5dce92d98ac0723143e917c62fb6ecaeb3a5358b0d81a6d290c4e48147889316", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\